  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "でかい　イカリを　ブンブン　ふりまわし\nホエルオーさえ　いちげきで　ＫＯ。\nみどりの　モズクが　ほんたいだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "큰 닻을 빙빙 휘둘러\n고래왕조차 일격에 KO 시킨다.\n녹색의 해초가 본체다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "來回揮舞巨大的船錨，\n連吼鯨王也能一擊打倒。\n綠色的海藻是牠的本體。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Avec un bon coup d’ancre bien senti, il peut\nmême assommer un Wailord. Son véritable corps\nest la partie composée de limon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wenn es seinen riesigen Anker schwingt, kann\nes sogar ein Wailord mit einem Schlag K.O.\nhauen. Der grüne Seetang ist sein Körper.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los giros de su enorme ancla son capaces de\nnoquear al mismísimo Wailord de un solo golpe.\nEl alga verde es su verdadero cuerpo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Roteando l’enorme ancora, è capace di mandare\nKO con un solo colpo persino un Wailord.\nIl suo vero corpo è composto da alghe verdi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Swinging its massive anchor, it can KO Wailord\nin a single blow. What appears to be green\nseaweed is actually its body.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "でかい　錨を　ブンブン　振り回し\nホエルオーさえ　一撃で　ＫＯ。\n緑の　モズクが　本体だ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "咣咣地来回摆动巨大的船锚，\n连吼鲸王也能一击击倒。\n绿色的海藻是它的本体。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los giros de su enorme ancla son capaces de\nnoquear al mismísimo Wailord de un solo golpe.\nEl alga verde es su verdadero cuerpo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "うみに　ただよう　モズクの　たましいが\nうまれかわった。　かいていの　ゴミを\nモズクに　からめて　からだを　たもつ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "바다를 떠도는 해초의 영혼이\n다시 태어났다. 해저의 쓰레기를\n해초에 감아서 몸을 유지한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "由海上飄蕩的海藻的魂魄轉生而成。\n利用海藻網羅海裡的垃圾，鞏固身體。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "C’est une réincarnation de l’âme des algues.\nSon corps est formé de détritus marins qu’il\nenveloppe de limon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist die Wiedergeburt der Seelen von im Meer\ntreibendem Seetang. Es schützt seinen Körper,\nindem es Meeresmüll an Seetang bindet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es la reencarnación del espíritu de las algas que\nflotan a la deriva. Protege su cuerpo acoplando\na las algas los desperdicios que halla en el mar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È la reincarnazione dello spirito delle alghe\nmarine. Si protegge stringendo a sé i rifiuti\nche trova in mare avvolgendoli nelle sue alghe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The soul of seaweed adrift in the waves became\nreborn as this Pokémon. It maintains itself with\nnew infusions of seabed detritus and seaweed.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "海に　漂う　モズクの　魂が\n生まれ変わった。　海の　ゴミを\nモズクに　絡めて　身体を　保つ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在海上飘荡的海藻的魂魄转生而成。\n用海藻网罗海里的垃圾，维持身体。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es la reencarnación del espíritu de las algas que\nflotan a la deriva. Protege su cuerpo acoplando\na las algas los desperdicios que halla en el mar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みどりのモズクを　からませ　せいきを\nうばい　すする。　ホエルオーみたいな\nおおものばかりを　このんで　ねらう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "녹색의 해초를 휘감아 생기를\n빨아들인다. 주로 고래왕처럼\n몸집이 큰 것을 노린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用綠色的海藻纏住獵物\n並奪取精氣。總是喜歡找上\n吼鯨王之類的大型對手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il enserre ses victimes de ses algues vertes\npour aspirer leur énergie vitale. Il ne chasse\nque les grosses proies, comme les Wailord.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wickelt grünes Seegras um seine Beute und\nsaugt ihr die Energie aus. Auf seinem Speiseplan\nstehen nur große Pokémon wie Wailord.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Envuelve a sus víctimas con su alga verde y les\nabsorbe la vitalidad. Se deleita en cazar solo\npresas de gran tamaño, como Wailord.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ruba l’energia vitale della preda avvolgendola\ncon le sue alghe verdi. Prende di mira solo\ni Pokémon di grossa stazza come Wailord.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
